WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.308
<v Therapist>Good afternoon. How are you today?

00:00:05.308 --> 00:00:13.769
<v Client>So I just went home and watched telly the whole evening. I was told to stop making such a fuss about it.

00:00:14.169 --> 00:00:18.015
<v Therapist>That reminds me of what you said about your father.

00:00:18.415 --> 00:00:22.646
<v Client>I was told to stop making such a fuss about it.

00:00:23.046 --> 00:00:25.046
<v Therapist>That's brave, saying it here.

00:00:25.446 --> 00:00:33.138
<v Client>Sort of a pressure, in my stomach somehow, but it's nothing much. Work is always the same, it never changes.

00:00:33.538 --> 00:00:38.154
<v Therapist>You say it was just strange. That sounds like more than strange.

00:00:38.554 --> 00:00:46.631
<v Client>You just keep functioning and somehow it works out. It was just a strange week, I guess, hard to say really.

00:00:47.031 --> 00:00:50.492
<v Therapist>You call that functioning. What would the opposite be?

00:00:53.492 --> 00:01:00.800
<v Client>You don't want to be a burden to anyone. I would never have thought I'd see it this clearly.

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:05.815
<v Therapist>A lot of people experience exactly that after an experience like this.

00:01:06.215 --> 00:01:13.523
<v Client>This week was hard, but at least now I know why. Work is always the same, it never changes.

00:01:13.923 --> 00:01:15.923
<v Therapist>Mhm, yes.

00:01:16.323 --> 00:01:21.323
<v Client>It is what it is, there's nothing you can do about it anyway.

00:01:21.723 --> 00:01:24.800
<v Therapist>What would you have needed in that moment?

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:32.800
<v Client>Mark said I should take a holiday. As if that would fix anything.

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:35.200
<v Therapist>Mhm.

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:40.600
<v Client>It is what it is, there's nothing you can do about it anyway.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:56.385
<v Client>Sometimes I think I never learned how to be liked. I only ever learned how to be needed. That's a different thing, and it makes me terribly tired, and lonely, and I'm a bit ashamed that I'm even saying it.

00:01:56.785 --> 00:01:59.862
<v Therapist>How was the rest of the week, work-wise?

00:02:02.862 --> 00:02:05.554
<v Client>Yeah. Um. Sleep is okay, I think.

00:02:05.954 --> 00:02:13.646
<v Client>I should have said something there, but I just didn't. This anger came up, and behind it was really hurt.

00:02:14.046 --> 00:02:16.046
<v Therapist>Mhm.

00:02:16.446 --> 00:02:24.523
<v Client>Sort of a pressure, in my stomach somehow, but it's nothing much. It was okay, nothing terrible, just how it goes.

00:02:24.923 --> 00:02:26.923
<v Therapist>Mhm, yes.

00:02:27.323 --> 00:02:31.169
<v Client>I was ashamed when I said it, quite badly actually.

00:02:31.569 --> 00:02:33.569
<v Therapist>Mhm.

00:02:33.969 --> 00:02:46.662
<v Client>My mother called, it was the same as ever, exhausting really. I would never have thought I'd see it this clearly. It was just a strange week, I guess, hard to say really.

00:02:47.062 --> 00:02:49.062
<v Therapist>Right.

00:02:49.462 --> 00:03:01.769
<v Client>My mother called, it was the same as ever, exhausting really. It was okay, nothing terrible, just how it goes. I felt bad, but don't ask me why, I have no idea.

00:03:02.169 --> 00:03:04.862
<v Therapist>Can you bear that at the moment?

00:03:07.862 --> 00:03:10.554
<v Client>I function, and that's enough for now.

00:03:10.954 --> 00:03:14.800
<v Therapist>You're describing a tightness. Where exactly do you feel it?

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:22.415
<v Client>With my boss I feel this old fear of getting something wrong.

00:03:22.815 --> 00:03:25.892
<v Therapist>What went through your mind in that moment?

00:03:28.892 --> 00:03:41.969
<v Client>I should have said something there, but I just didn't. This week was hard, but at least now I know why. It is what it is, there's nothing you can do about it anyway.

00:03:42.369 --> 00:03:45.062
<v Therapist>When did you first have this feeling?

00:03:48.062 --> 00:03:57.677
<v Client>It was just a strange week, I guess, hard to say really. There was this tightness in my chest, and I think that was fear.

00:03:58.077 --> 00:04:02.692
<v Therapist>A lot of people experience exactly that after an experience like this.

00:04:03.092 --> 00:04:06.554
<v Therapist>Let's stop there for today. See you next week.

00:04:06.954 --> 00:04:09.646
<v Client>Yes. Thank you. See you next week.
